Open Vanilla / Open Vanilla 0020 — faster loads and the Open Vanilla name on the realm pages.

* web/boot.js: compile the Response fetch() returned, so the browser can keep the compiled wasm
  with its HTTP cache entry (returning players skip recompiling ~90 MB). The progress bar reads
  a clone. Boot prefetch 8 -> 24 at once (HTTP/2/3, ~160 ms US round trips).
* scripts/web-build.sh: brotli -q 11 (built once per image); WEB_REQUIRE_OPT=1 makes a build
  without wasm-opt fail instead of shipping a slower module (the realm Dockerfile sets it).
* Realm pages: the play and sign-in pages, the home-screen app name and the web manifest say
  Open Vanilla; the Discord "not in the server" message too.

